OpenRange contains no third-party solver code. Its solver is an original
implementation of published algorithms (CFR, CFR+, Discounted CFR).

OpenRange depends on third-party open-source packages (Rust crates and npm
packages). Each is used under its own license. The full, generated list with
license identifiers is in docs/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md
(regenerate with: npm run licenses).

The prebuilt WebAssembly file in web/public/wasm/ is compiled from this
repository's crates/ directory together with the Rust crates listed in that
report.
